  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112ce18f4e8645da9a63b59d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真希望这瞬间的灿烂能成为永恒……\\n我幸福到不禁这么想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d2292d3f7adacd423e162221062fb8f13f2bd3a81b5627be0f61463a34b65c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "749"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/749"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd640bd74dfb2f4156fe4a15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欸嘿♪那是请朋友边教我边做出来的\\n致胜料理！之后会上传影片喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbac2bb6096bdce185eb57497483b5b678de1ed1a3481531acfde813307b7fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "75"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/75"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccc7886cf55b1b939f9b775",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由衷地感谢……你愿意相信我的双脚，\\n并带领我抵达这阵光辉之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6562d44dcefb5c5e70b64411b4d57b1d1f530ef2133b787725b483d4bb808fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "750"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/750"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bd76ecdb8dd05598031388",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是不要畏惧去看清自己的本质。\\n我认为那正是迈向真正强悍的一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad223506890776090b7c3892ed3d7ed4dff7d8ef5190a038205423b87340477b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "751"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/751"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec9fdbbaaa43f4cfa437ade8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我依然还远远不及那种境界。\\n我还想在战斗当中……继续燃烧自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed4b254f41106efaa451c6c3433acb7546390986ffd5b5a4b5034ccf0142835",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "752"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/752"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28e6637a8e9b0c89cd144866",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我由衷地感谢目白家的荣耀，\\n在一路上支持我抵达这座巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dca2a54228550e043b072cc4d4088da392bb649af5e8d8207cf94537c456e3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "755"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/755"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbfdccdd5405c5e9f6e90873",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像期盼已久的季节来临了一般，\\n心中感到既愉快又温暖呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "97756e67a60ce6ff0d085a2bfb4faa6e172c4dbe44b7f979b83ec2ba367207f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "756"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/756"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80aa8378a6a3a2c23444da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别输给冬天的寒冷，学着忍耐并储蓄力量。\\n你累积的努力一定可以绽放出花朵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "626f145d18b82919f9c6e858902cb46491bc558b82ed2b010935a957896ddbf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "759"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/759"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd26ce1c9d1a96b9a98b212",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真机伶因为有大家的支持才会这么可爱，\\n所以真机伶会再用这份可爱来答谢大家♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8a74f65625cbdd68aa08e8be11ac5c3640671b03b6d2783540942d310ce5ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "76"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/76"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c06be2620fc2ea34f5316826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这真是超乎预期的快乐结局！\\n不过──我的樱花还不到凋落的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a679713b17cd43fcf491f5596a6f6b4a5c08b8d7c3ead609e617f20b90b7393e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "760"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/760"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4e5cd34df8cb595d086b9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还只是个挑战者！\\n会更加努力迈向日本第一的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018f7ae0dca168d4ae933bcd8f4acbe50168cd5d99cabb77a3f4022d159a8e8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "761"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/761"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1153ea4a302c882c44c39695",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员跟妈妈，然后还有──\\n呃……太多人了根本无法决定～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7427a8f7218ec241ec63b3229952106b5319a2bda1e5b22924cb253353a3f362",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "762"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/762"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:086010964b8fe2ccfa046f44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为什么你会知道……是的，\\n等出席过队伍的庆功宴之后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b474d15b0badf85d1e769952eb759ec79417924d3b9b35fa9fd84f5d2c6e4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "763"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/763"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e1c01d8e235c0ccd78db12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有特别做什……啊，闸位的颜色\\n好像是幸运色？是别人告诉我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d534dcc7d5db69613153441762e66771035d89f85a87d5c8c11026e4b67cf92c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "764"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/764"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22dbb3802cc5c5929de3afb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然！而且还要「浓稠双倍增量」！\\n今天就尽情地加入自己喜欢的配料吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e9d2a484829d6d9e9477c60a9686495252a27a468fcfd9635ac1aa2959b3e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "765"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/765"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac6760797fa0bda8d24403f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与队伍的大家开庆功宴！\\n也得叫训练员一起来热闹一下呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d358c172fad4d9bcd5604dcb319f6720ff2fe16387d50a8ac77a60a6b69abcc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "766"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/766"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58738a2a57325e2f21dd50ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后也会拿出酷炫又完美的表现给大家看，\\n恳请支持啰☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4fc95b08cb4fa2bb4802d9330e6e5e4201744526f69f44c12463c0fbf579894",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "767"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/767"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6483eb719264dbce8e0ca9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有啊，我想在舞台上多追加一个站台！\\n这样肯定会变得像迪斯科舞厅一样热闹喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e3258fd09889bc7d74313e6e30e8be4b09e6753a2b8ac613bb4a3714b5a509",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "768"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/768"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee6f99d3ea1c0b497b64e62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这里对我而言还是在舞台之上。\\n「后台」发生的事就等有空时再说……好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8489d62f83a36e94dc60466a0e2b2db65cc42b5c0202ce4fc7572bb6043b7d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "769"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/769"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab62d8bc42feff7427634fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是只在公主战士第19话出现的稀有姿势！\\n摆出来后人就会热血沸腾起来所以很推荐喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9894f26dbd86aef4a123f9186ea8ced14ddf2808d1aed609255d401a45911131",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "77"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/77"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ae5e76a7349a7861355225",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别哭啊！来，用这条手帕……\\n（飞出鸽子）呵呵，眼泪这下停住了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6ff5dc4ac468f73c0b488d27488667705807febc0cdce8dd244c95a5e55243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "770"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/770"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2dd5f6b643adea97f44f9ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，炒面、关东煮、土手煮、炸串、\\n板条……还有炸金川烧和（以下略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "abff7a22d25ca2d6d12b3a0fb12746d010255381d1964288a0455504221b6d21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "771"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/771"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39597c66d45368560374cf71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有点难为情呢……但既然如此，\\n我接下来想以「终极赛马娘」为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a905962131dfda02c615d7aa710c947f3ef03cabc7ce458ce6712273d13aec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "772"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/772"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9ee6f92675c7ad06262faf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从一开始就没有什么敌人啦。大家都是\\n无可取代的同伴……是家人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea31fe42938abd5e46a44671b9d40e5ac8e47530c932da111c7087f84dd8b0e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "773"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/773"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07104b61e9e10282938262fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦！就知道你会有那种要求，\\n所以我已经派出企鹅传书送出去啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb8c2e8a6f4dc07ac44fd12bd6976f6b9f5c85a7874702bafb9d13d0094d53a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "774"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/774"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fff8315b46ebd9d3f91f4d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我已经来到这里了……\\n但可不会一直等下去，所以你也快点来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9056eb1675747a090d8142ee55b84824a3a3b9085d0ee46b8e350ea46fa440f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "775"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/775"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf82212869291a8b455bb84d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就只是顺着风随兴地跑下去……\\n然后和一定要打败她的那家伙一决高下而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d9b93cb18f995b616f1b54aa282420493ad4d5284904eb820d4ad156840c82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "776"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/776"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:badb8c7a04097435a6e67a46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我已经透过竞赛把自己的心情都说完了。\\n……接下来就只等对方的回复！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95577b9ca6c74af0f98061b3a436c23d9f319184439a62a9447e2df2d6d3e1ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "777"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/777"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d423c0e37ad8d9d051a3c8cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一旦爬上了山顶，就代表下山的时刻来临。\\n所以我会从起点再一次爬上去♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6792beaca1aa66ee9572f830e68b0822b35dd412ba04f35cd24297f3302edcb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "778"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/778"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d40f464550ced66840b7bfd6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然是要办一场Big party！\\n不管是谁都Welcome！大家一起狂欢吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dabe2db29914b577d7d741985eb8b352dfb053b5d04a0f15e35e9b3ec8383fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "779"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/779"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff11cf495e3d4eead41c3fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为公主的吉祥物，它每天都有在成长喔♪\\n前阵子还学会了「突击」呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db84d5d4a99d364b05262958ed12d6b24838323325110cf4523e010b284c1cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "78"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/78"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c39242623408e5f64bf39e7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先要给训练员一个热情的Hug！\\n这次可不会让他Runaway啰～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76973c23d294cc2841b30075cbf2515ec83798b0ebcf2e905053984abee8fab8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "780"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/780"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd62381ddfe32c3b4f54f40d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "「断而敢行，鬼神避之」，\\n总之我没有让自己在气势上输给别人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1431f1c90c2e496ebf2d5af26ff0babae51759d1d1363520fe29eed0403f43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "781"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/781"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c61df02c45e0a4f0f2dc9a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然是在竞赛中赌上一切较量过的同伴……\\n我想彼此之间已无须言语了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7283a83eef13a7e2d2dc962593f99e9adf61523073f1240a50157a603089f0d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "782"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/782"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb76a69fc2e6759ca1b9d3b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的单挑对决让你们热血沸腾了对吧？\\n嘿嘿，今后也别把视线给移开喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de03cedfcecfb4a6915c2f6e3a8b60c063ff0e74cd8b4e92e07c18b98b499f44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "783"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/783"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc71a23fe954057d535da27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练公！多亏你我才能跑出精彩的对决！\\n等我做些好吃的答谢你啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4285f5ae1f4c865d8a9c7a657c7fd12ff9a1c2bd51039729b1a85b5a6b1b51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "784"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/784"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a220436504c4d9a83f602c84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然是我期待已久的甜点──！\\n啊…‥这也是为了要补充营养喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd91af534e25deff0d12541038599b39c5f4695be96909b3cf92a5180657b16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "785"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/785"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd974cf7dd1027384485cec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总是给予我支持的目白家成员，\\n以及与我互相切磋琢磨的各位！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a06aaae1e7a688a69d2f7d5257096bfd7f65e4fddfef58fb102b41c2ba76cd78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "786"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/786"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6efd95362d3d0dab3651a425",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最强！最棒！最精彩！这样\\n就距离无敌──世界第一又更近了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b426a6344066a5536c9a5b3e0b95d800dffe94e26fa6538dacd60d684b3c03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "787"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/787"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f06eda37e91b2af5d6e47a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然是家人……还有所有劲敌们！\\n我们的对决之后也要继续下去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e4cc39748558c57f3ce6877111ed6864edf5fe37545105b1eddf7501a197d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "788"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/788"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e099bcd68d9ea82d4b9ea226",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我确实也看到了喔。岂止是微笑，那副姿态\\n根本是高声大笑！哈──哈、哈、哈！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f21fea7ff5d9dcecf7f0dda321b659abdf20e81ec6c44be336664eedc4026ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "789"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/789"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32ae59dd885edf2808015c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能跑出有自己风格的表现我就心满意足了。\\n不过还打算更进一步，朝优胜迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9210049419e45a010be9cbeb06276ebd3a8e52134533d6c8bb1971143d9c72d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "79"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/79"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c195dd5c67ef589514b9576",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这还只是第一个夜晚……瓦尔哈拉尚在远方。\\n和我一起前往……那应许之地的尽头吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22b549d420a5908da7099e85a5dee59fe4af85316226fa6288a4be881cc2699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "790"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/790"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36dd4bee8523362d210fb81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "都是些眼神凌厉的家伙……这样正好。\\n老实说，很久没有如此让人感兴趣的对决了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d122de7ed0e0a4e31194ed72877abe632e12d319ad45343a69dcbdc4b2756325",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "791"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/791"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16ebb16b347401e72be15929",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么可能……跑了场燃烧不完全的竞赛后，\\n渴望「下次」的身体已经在隐隐作痛了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "430f83caead7e9dca309410ccc520b509587f21629dea0a2d5e4983a196b220a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "792"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/792"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd97dfbae3949bd9c9d6ff3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有人为此高兴不已呢。呵呵，能看到那些\\n绽放出笑容的脸孔也让人相当愉快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd1436e16dbb1712ec7f0f72ca84d9e0049c89833ee8a119226d2f0590043a36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "793"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/793"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996e3c922176302297bf9457",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万千思绪也不过只是转瞬梦境。\\n因此只需志在千里，无穷无尽地向前迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64a66ac593c80310c5704aafb19dd5554903aee5d249cf957a4439acdc61276",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "794"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/794"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8ca95a40e3c66ecef02ae9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就……妈妈……这就是我如今的表现。\\n今后也会继续以你为指标向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "235306a696f5ecde05b31f227312f293ae1d5b034958b2058678c02a5cd1f1c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "795"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/795"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a9af8980ccea9e14b88b33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些紫色的玫瑰，是粉丝刚才送给我的……\\n呵呵，我会心怀感激地装饰在房间里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "066773ce0766fcba97cb3cf3a6ccb6bac479479c23b113c5217b26853fa9cf33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "796"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/796"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a368a41e4a3a3ef1cca1a1be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有没有……！这一定是因为有\\n训练员这位大贤者的力量加持！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be33cfa97a922e3bc448105a6a87273e8d9374a708e96a50cb0a4a5e3459b75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "797"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/797"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25dd92d274644d02c2582a48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想将今天的回忆深深烙印在心中，\\n并且将心中这股火爆的激情表达出来！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94a09a3d58faba99f8a4d2d81bed1302af0caa79dfaaf328ab0b8f9be8a3760",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "798"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/798"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2762dc084378ee3b8c7f37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啰──训练员有在看吗──？\\n……就说小青该出手时就会出手对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8775a2e09d3d90c2319c82b5b8a9dd5b2cadd4577ba6f455cb434ad9f1ed8172",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "799"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/799"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d18096db6394593c17c3d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是不沉浸在感伤的情绪之中！\\n去兜风的话，郁闷的心情也会一扫而空喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e43205b68cc5a885ba6e1e6b220b84d20aa25c7b3791a245d349fc818109cb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "8"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/8"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d4d3cd98ae7696e3808ac9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "模特儿是模特儿，竞赛是竞赛，两者无关。\\n不要把它们混为一谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5036f6a6db3a6c6f05a739879f1637c1cc642b1f4863c9f9132693d044660b80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "80"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/80"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77af72aa3551355cad3fed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵～你正摆出「怎么可能」的表情吧？\\n我就想看到那种表情呢──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d992cf214173c5f301208010d504666f8c0fdd70f5ed0540c4852408e7d38b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "800"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/800"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebcc0d3edf6fc9a56845d56e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的家人们都有在看吗～～！！？\\n一起去痛快地大吃一顿美食吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c8dfc57d32c8e762c0021be3691bade0d0fc54211c0399dddcee9a7a9efb46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "801"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/801"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022a207ea82089bf57c0fea6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真的很谢谢大家为我加油……！\\n你们的心情，都有好好地传达给我啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f7024e4965d57ae01b08c07d04328fad8931d29264295a5f89f262fd165b24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "802"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/802"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b9752987388287702a6870",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我认为自己的表现，能为祖国和这个国家之间\\n开启一道崭新的历史大门……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aced44747c92bba946dd717734cdb6dda8f24537a944c998e8fd4cf6ea12ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "803"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/803"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:298eef83d88f3695b2e62005",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些欢呼声，还有大家的表情……我绝对\\n不会忘记这片景色。我获得了宝贵的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5483e802275a7362117edf9d5f9a44782b0f1affbd61fe207c874fbf4086dc5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "804"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/804"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d6fb546ab8da095da42c47c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想自己应该或多或少有带给大家\\n一场有趣的竞赛了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d93096bb970da7b4810af1b81844b16bf6732c8040626c527b66549853215a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
