    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857820948f0c25a35b16ce5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "父亲、母亲……还有白仁。我们就全家一起去\\n吃顿饭，然后一边慢慢地聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5489d7ecc7c9b2506970c74caf4b2e9d8f9144445bab0bcd6b5a8a72e52fa4f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "806"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/806"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56275b580821ad46708a3c3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就说人家会展现出最完美的飞行给你看！\\n跟我说的一样对吧，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ba3c41f727ef824f11595672aa2ccf0fa700ce8d021c49ae290858b606aaae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "807"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/807"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b6fed1d1508e502b9787e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感谢大家的声援～☆谢礼是……啾♪\\n欸嘿嘿，这是感谢的着陆Kiss！",
      "source_fingerprint": "febacfc2ecf442e5d3fef24ee0d8709cb0fcb55f114191d6906fcb98dafc91fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "808"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/808"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964dabbb247b53560ff31b5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那道影子……看起来似乎更近了一点──\\n虽然它还是非常遥远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a4cadf7427697d8e1b634c3c78e5a2d6ed22e5633885664b9f7166db1d9089",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "809"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/809"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109193cb4563a17d999f4330",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有的！姿态端正、声音洪亮且很有人望！\\n我从大家身上感受到了不输给我的班长之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b4fc1e71ef4fc1c9b61d8cbeec726d03e3352690be31bb7b6835758757674c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "81"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/81"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a9901bd2411fd77b2a8acad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在安静的场所一边喝着咖啡……\\n一边回味今天发生的事情并牢牢地记住……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd1cbca2b88d02afd3b24105355d8115f52677f8bdb392e4c62a0b93bb086ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "810"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/810"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed74e8f979e85460a2d457c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感谢。我判断之所以能完成这次的任务，\\n是因为有教练在的缘故。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f12c0287a87ece028a59f9b175df6eed371158a4465b69f3cbb48e3a995d5ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "811"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/811"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf0db3c5631d49d9b523a89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "搜寻中……发生错误。\\n思考回路超过负荷，无法输出词汇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08400548b15d2f8149a4d0cb56a52eb960b49eae3f0b0fc400ed3b0cef1281f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "812"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/812"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5790bc11046ed2f11aba5cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还不能代表目白家……\\n但很荣幸能以家族成员的身份上场表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4039e3492b0022d72ecf6d0dbef07addb36bda1ac374f2875bcb054d0918e73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "813"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/813"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627e9a7e01ac0685dde6622a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是你们呼唤「赖恩」的声音\\n推着我往前进的！谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "318449cd9dafef1400fc355fe7cf4e115614f35dadf017700189bca349a72436",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "814"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/814"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eec3acffc0a0c100b5aae2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应该是举办一场庆功派对，然后\\n邀请很多人来品尝我做的料理吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941fa75fae40fa6ff78f45c71ec6ed9fd024dc36c9e756609862bb870a860c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "815"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/815"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba3381616e9178106bc03ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要和队伍成员一起举办胜利火锅派对～♪\\n希望同场竞赛的对手们也都能来参加呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "15f6b0511f7b4798651b93f323ada296b06d61e37eed272cfa50ed44adc8a200",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "816"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/816"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66d44c6c3ac4f2f0f34f0e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能得到这么多人的祝福……真是太感激了……\\n感觉等一下走路会忍不住小跳步呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e157f28ab764a23e6a946bb10e8927133888a147995ebc6511c2fa609cd934",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "817"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/817"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4023c2441d5418746f385591",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "盛冈的记者！刚才有看到我的表现吗！？\\n耶嘿嘿，故乡的大家应该都很惊讶吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74134691532b0ca84d3a23d019691df4f24a27b75cd35cb98320f423f3b6527",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "818"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/818"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8c8ecf1c00ad7543babae5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我……我……我好高兴。获胜后，\\n竟然能得到这么多人的祝福……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ca6d5c010f530c18127d586aa6cf86866daed5c1eb61ebfb3790d3b26e2a2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "819"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/819"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cdea4a63b49c3d6a82d2cad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应该是绕口令吧！塔滑汤洒汤烫塔！\\n爆爆进进爆进进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ccaebf62222b0f97036b5dfde32008331e3c2b3e0a992f8759bcdf1d41e1285",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "82"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/82"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c06cfb786a5c9e225eeffca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴尽力了……尽力了喔！\\n因为有大……有训练员在我身边的缘故！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77627d5cf85894a08465bfb39a935928be69e5168868f845efe9f53be384266f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "820"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/820"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97657d5aed7370ae45d1a5b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你这个人啊，看起来比我还开心耶！\\n呵呵，这就是你的优点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481c296455e9f61bba0dd19ef4d86ab8747cda88a68d604e2bae30552515252e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "821"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/821"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafb2da2b401ecce3d954aa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有大家的笑容就足够了！反倒是我\\n想要和大家说声「谢谢你们的支持」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10be10b08a01668efa81797dba991591c5f606af4efecbe4a4eff1602ce25cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "822"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/822"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63e9cef033d9389a166dcbb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么可能，只是再次理解「可能性永无止境」\\n而已。但光是这样就有其意义了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d8a91bd7d1b7b40c17524ef8a4af4a4123153e30f35b48d26156bbcc06c00c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
